From b1d43c047528c0a0b5b1940ef12b586345c20c64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:55:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] Add Couch Party (8-player local VS/Battle),
 split-screen styles, DATA screen records

- Main menu: the 3P/4P columns become COUCH PARTY with VS and BATTLE.
- The character screen becomes a lobby: each controller presses A to join
  (up to 8), picks a character and readies up; START goes on.
- Couch races run as a 1P-screen VS race or Battle with every joined player
  human, drawn with per-player views; each player keeps their controller.
- 8-player VS grid and Battle start spots, VS finish (all but one), battle
  eliminations for 8, VS items, rankings and minimap for every player.
- Results panel: places, session wins, race again / change course /
  change drivers / quit.
- Split screen setting: automatic, side by side, stacked, two rows.
- DATA screen: Track Records panel with the leaderboard of the highlighted
  track.
- Fixes for 8-player races: audio finish array was 4 long, Boo item steal
  and Lakitu rendering only covered the first players.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qq7B1uqfWVWykYRDDMiuXa
